  (text "Notes\nU4: straps: MODE[2:0] internal pull-ups = all capable; PHYAD0 internal pull-down = address 0; nINTSEL pulled low (R33) = pin 14 is REFCLKO, 50 MHz to the MCU; REGOFF internal pull-down = regulator on\nC41: at pin 1\nC42: at pin 19\nC43: VDDIO\nC44: VDDCR, with C45\nY3: CL 20 pF, +/-50 ppm total (LAN8742A datasheet)\nC46: for CL 20 pF with about 4 pF stray"
    (at 15.24 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 865dabff-5050-560d-aa4b-748b7cf6a264)
  )
  (text "\nR31: series, at the PHY\nR33: strap nINTSEL = 0 (REFCLKO mode)\nR34: PHY runs if the firmware leaves PD11 as input\nU5: flow-through: route each line across pins 1/10, 2/9, 4/7, 5/6\nJ2: client network\nR39: LED1 = link/activity, active high (REGOFF strap low)\nR40: LED2 = speed, active high (nINTSEL strap low)"
    (at 210.82 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 5cd69e0b-6835-5b5c-8f94-d2a5b970b171)
  )

